  "delivered": [
    "Immutable hash-identified custom declarative scalar-range registrations; no supplied JavaScript execution.",
    "Explicit sampled method, units, controlling rig, parts, relationship, frame and raw artifact evidence; missing measurements and missing required output frames fail. Sparse/empty intervals retain their scope or unreviewed state. Full output-frame coverage does not establish continuous collision.",
